      "why_not_fabricated": "These are the paper's own computational results for the C15 Laves phases, traceable to Table 1, Fig. 1, Fig. 2."
    },
    {
      "path": "grading_spec_json.inline",
      "purpose": "Gold Fermi-level density of states N(E_F) for Cr2Zr, Cr2Zr0.5Nb0.5, Cr2Nb.",
