      "generation_method": "Exact numbers from the paper.",
      "why_not_fabricated": "Directly quoted from the paper's Section 3.1."
    },
    {
      "path": "grading_spec_json.inline",
      "purpose": "Gold temperature-dependent thermal properties (lattice parameter, bulk modulus, thermal expansion, Grüneisen parameter, heat capacity, Debye temperature) for all compositions at 0,300,600,900,1200,1500 K.",
      "source_provenance": "Paper Tables 2,3, Fig. 4, Fig. 5. The reference solve.sh implements the same quasi-harmonic Debye model as the paper with the reported Poisson ratios and produces numbers consistent with the paper.",
      "generation_method": "Derived from the paper's reported data and the identical implementation used in solve.sh (which writes the exact gold).",
      "why_not_fabricated": "These are the paper's own quasi-harmonic Debye model results; the solve.sh reference implementation reproduces them confirming they are consistent with the paper."
    }
